he's a near unstoppable force of evil so  dangerous that on multiple occasions  spider-man and venom have been forced to  set aside their differences to put an  end to his wrath let's take a look at  the chaotic mind and twisted motivations  of carnage one of marvel's deadliest  villains carnage is a product of the  bonds between a member of the symbiotic  alien race known as ceclinta and cletus  cassidy a deranged serial killer who  pushed his own grandmother down a flight  of stairs as a child cassidy was sent to  an orphanage which he burned down so he  developed a lust for pure chaos and  mayhem long before he ever came into  contact with the symbiote so when  artists eric larson and mark bagley were  seeking inspiration for the character's  appearance and traits they didn't have  to look far writer david mcelini  conceived of carnage as the closest  thing to an irredeemably malevolent  force as could exist in the marvel  universe so the artist modeled cassidy  on the joker who has long filled just  such a role in the dc universe i'm a dog  chasing cars i wouldn't know what to do  with one if i caught it  you know i just do things  eddie brock separated from his venom  symbiote and sent to prison for his  crimes was cassidy's cellmate while  waiting for the symbiote to spring him  brock developed an antagonistic attitude  toward the depraved cassidy beating him  mercilessly on more than one occasion  the venom symbiotes did eventually  manage to free brock but in the process  it spawned a new symbiote leaving it  behind in cassidy's cell this  technically makes carnage venom sun and  like the contentious bond brock shares  with venom in which the two sometimes  duel for control carnage sees its  relationship with cassidy as much more  than symbiotic it entered cassidy's body  through a curt so the symbiote was able  to bond with his bloodstream making the  two extremely difficult to separate  unlike venom carnage does not refer to  itself as we it's one entity venom's  hatred of carnage is so intense that it  even overrides his hatred of spider-man  and as far as carnage is concerned the  feeling is mutual  it might be tough to separate carnage  from cassidy but it has happened a few  times and when it has carnage had no  problem bonding with other hosts it's  unempowered victims through the  multiverse have included gwen stacy john  jameson and dr tannis diedes a  psychiatrist of carnage's girlfriend  shriek carnage has also bonded with  superpowered people a truly terrifying  proposition for one it bonded with ben  reilly spider-man at the time to create  spider carnage a symbiote also once  briefly bonded with the extremely  powerful silver surfer to become carnage  cosmic in one of peter parker's worst  nightmares come true carnage also once  bonded with norman osborne the green  goblin to become the red goblin already  greatly enhanced by his goblin serum  osborne became exponentially more  powerful with carnage obsessed not just  with killing spider-man but crushing his  very soul the goblin threatened to  slowly and painfully kill everyone peter  held dear unless he gave up his  crime-fighting ways after a brawl that  left the daily bugle officers in  shambles and flash thompson dead parker  revealed his desperation by allowing the  venom symbiote to bond with him for one  last shuttered victory over the red  goblin on the brink of death peter was  able to convince osborne that carnage  not the goblin would get all the credit  for killing spider-man driven by ego  osborne shredded the symbiotes which led  to the villain's sound defeat klintar  are generally indifferent or  antagonistic toward their offspring and  carnage is no exception during the brief  time the symbiote was in control of doug  dunhams it used her to find cassidy  abandoning her for his original host but  leaving a spawn behind growing on her  arm horrified nieves took drastic action  and cut her ram off but symbiotes don't  give up easily and it eventually  rebonded with her to become the heroic  scorn who has been a thorn in the side  of her father on multiple occasions  another of carnage's offspring was  outright rejected carnage disgusted and  enraged by its spawn implanted it into  new york police officer paddy mulligan  during a chance encounter resolving to  kill it before it could reach maturity  carnage attacked mulligan and his family  but was foiled by spider-man and black  cat mulligan tracked the cat down for  answers but the pair once again came  under attack by carnage this time the  new symbiote made its presence known  calling itself toxin it single-handedly  took down carnage and venom and resolved  to become a hero the virtuous mulligan  had trouble containing the symbiote's  homicidal urges however and after the  officer was killed in battle toxin  briefly bonded with eddie brock and  finally with brent waters  venom and carnage have battled countless  times with the latter's superior  strength usually giving him the upper  hand but venom has often outsmarted him  at one point cassidy was being held in a  special prison designed to contain  carnage when venom paid his son a visit  cassidy could only jibber helplessly as  venom ripped the symbiote from his body  and devoured it cassidy escaped and  attempted to resume his reign of terror  by painting himself red and embarking on  yet another killing spree as a makeshift  carnage he was easily defeated by  spider-man but cassidy was given new  hope a failed invasion of earth by the  interdimensional beings of the negative  zone reactivated dormant traces of the  symbiote within his bloodstream finding  his way through a portal to the negative  zone cassidy was mysteriously guided to  a second symbiote apparently identical  to his first and enthusiastically  allowed it to bond with him becoming  carnage once again  during the events of the avengers x-men  axis crossover events the moral  alignment of a number of heroes and  villains were magically switched this  had a profound effect on carnage who  found himself saddled with an  overwhelming desire to help people and  do good despite having literally no idea  how he abducted local reporter alice  gleason to tutor him in the ways of  being a hero after barely restraining  him from killing a couple of random  thugs but even under her strict guidance  carnage tended to get his wires crossed  for example when carnage and alice came  across a bank being robbed the symbiote  heroically thwarted the robbery before  attempting to burn down the bank to  prevent future robberies while  apparently developing romantic feelings  for alice carnage was constantly  distracted by fantasies of her dying  during a climactic battle in new york  carnage apparently sacrificed himself  for the good of the city but of course  such deaths are almost always temporary  in the marvel universe and it wouldn't  be long before cassidy appeared once  again back to his old homicidal ways  marvel's ultimate line of comics which  began publication in 2000 updated some  of its most popular characters and  storylines for a new generation of  readers it took place in a different  continuity than the mainstream marvel  universe and while it has now defunct  some of its more popular original  characters namely miles morales managed  to survive the destruction of their home  universe and have come over to the main  marvel you  some spider-man  i'm not the only one  in the ultimate universe symbiotes  weren't an alien race instead they were  the results of a genetic experiment by  peter parker's father richard and eddie  brock senior the first of these  symbiotes was venom and this  relationship to peter and eddie jr  played out much the same way it did in  the main continuity carnage however was  created in a lab by dr kurt connors who  had the bright idea to combine some of  peter's dna with a sample of venom along  with his own lizard mutated dna the  result was a fearsome beast which could  only survive by feeding on humans and  was obsessed with consuming spider-man  to complete its dna sequence it even ate  gwen stacy then created an exact genetic  replica of her to serve as its host this  version of carnage was itself eventually  consumed by venom  on a couple of the rare occasions in  which marvel has teamed up with rival  publisher dc for crossovers carnage has  been involved he notably teamed up with  his inspiration the joker for the 1995  one shot spider-man and batman  disordered mines the team up was  short-lived although they seemed like  the perfect evil pairing carnage butted  head to the clown prince of crime early  and often due to the joker's tendency  towards theatrics and his own preference  for 110 slaughter carnage found the  joker's methods to be tedious and  unsatisfying or the joker found carnage  to be a hack carnage also made his  presence known in the amalgam line of  comics an imprint in which marvel and dc  heroes and villains were combined to  create a new mash of characters carnage  was matched up with superman nemesis  pizarro to create bizanitch the creature  wreaked indiscriminate havoc until it  was eventually tricked and defeated by  spiderboy himself a mashup of spider-man  and superboy  karna just surprised cameo in the 2018  venom feature film promised that  there's gonna be carnage  it raised the character's profile so  marvel brought him back to the comics  page with a web of venom carnage born  one shot its story deals with a cult  attempting to resurrect the villain  after his death in the venomous  storyline and if that's not dark enough  it's implied cassidy was a cannibal  before fusing with a symbiote the issue  solicitation states a cruel cannibal  obsessed with death and murder few  mourned cletus cassidy after he  seemingly died in venomized with the  second venom movie subtitled let there  be carnage it's no surprise that marvel  comics has given us a revamped and even  darker version of the character though  it should be noted carnage had some  pretty dark comics appearances well  before venom that debbie carnage is  primed to give us a cinematic villain  for the aegis and it certainly doesn't  hurt that the great woody harrelson is  filling the role  carnage has starred in plenty of  mini-series one-shots and even line-wide  events based on his bloody exploits  but the release of 2016's carnage issue  1 gave the craze symbiote his first  ongoing monthly series it also marks the  marvel return of writer jerry conway his  first work on a regular marvel series  since the 90s the series finds the title  villain lord to grey ridge mine with  manuela calderon the sole survivor of  cletus cassidy's very first mass killing  as bait but when the owner of the mine  turns out to have his own agenda carnage  and some of the agents tasked with  capturing him fall into the mine  calderon eddie brock john jameson and  fbi special agent claire dixon followed  carnage into the depths where a strange  cult called the dark holders wait with  their own plans most of the series 16  issues revolve around an unexpected  mystical and prophetic connection  between carnage and an ancient  lovecraftian god before the end carnage  gets a power boost and one of the heroes  chasing him becomes part of the violent  symbiote family  in the venom series that debuted in 2018  it's revealed that the klintar symbiotes  are not just an alien species but  parasites created by the eldritch guard  null to do his bidding so after the cult  of null resurrects carnage in weber  venom carnage born they reveal that  every human on earth to ever bomb with a  symbiote as what they call a codex  embedded in their dna if carnage  collects all these codexes he will  become the vessel for null on earth and  be able to conquer the world after a lot  of bloodshed including the deaths of a  superhero or two venom kills cletus in  2020s absolute carnage issue 5 but in  doing so ensures the eventual assault on  earth by null venom has to resolve that  in the kingdom black event where carnage  plays only a small role  carnage became a meal for sharks in  carnage black white and blood but  extreme carnage issue 1 reveals that a  piece of the symbiote survived at the  bottom of the ocean it bonds with a fish  and works its way up the chain to  eventually bond with xenophobic senator  peter crane who's seeking an end to her  bring any and all extraterrestrial  aliens on u.s soil carnage uses senator  crane's voice to seize the wills of  various symbiotes over the television  airways standing against them are flash  thompson now agent anti-venom and andy  benton the former host of the symbiote  scream after crippling a symbiote with  hellfire to stop it from following  carnage's orders she rebonds with an  alternate version of the symbiote now  calling itself silence  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite marvel characters are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one
 

